`settings.section` client slot;\n- the `webServer` host service;\n- Loader readiness after eve"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ry enabled Cordis fiber becomes active."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The package intentionally remains marked `private: true` to prevent npm publication. Making the GitH"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ub repository public does not require removing that guard."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Local validation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Use Node.js 22 or later:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The `@deepseek-ai` packages require registry read access. Supply a short-lived `NPM_TOKEN` through\nt"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"he process environment and the local npm configuration described by the package owner; never put\na c"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"oncrete token in this repository. `validate` checks the exact npm package versions and contract\ndecl"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"arations, JavaScript syntax, the vendored Registry, and the complete Node test suite.\n`pack:check` i"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"nspects the package manifest without publishing it and rejects local npm configuration."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Harness integration"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The host entry is `dist/index.mjs`. It provides the extension manager, Workshop bridge, and agent ec"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"osystem services, registers the loopback-only management API, and installs the `official-v2` runtime"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"-ready adapter. `official-v2` is OMDSH's adapter API version; it is not a snapshot name."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The prebuilt client entry is `dist/client.js`. It contributes the Extensions settings section throug"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"h the standard client manifest and supports Installed, Discover, collections, recipes, updates, and "},{"id":"p13s3","text":" client manifest and supports Installed, Discover, collections, recipes, updates, and history views."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The npm registry did not provide `@deepseek-ai/dsh-repository-plugin` when this candidate was\nchecke"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"d. Git-source catalog entries therefore remain visible as guided integrations and OMDSH does\nnot cla"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"im that they can be installed through an npm-provided Repository Plugin. This repository\ndoes not co"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"py a private or Git-snapshot implementation to fill that gap."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The management endpoint is `/omdsh/extensions/v1`. Mutation requests are restricted to a loopback Ho"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"st, reject cross-site Fetch Metadata, and require a matching HTTP Origin when an Origin header is pr"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ject cross-site Fetch Metadata, and require a matching HTTP Origin when an Origin header is present."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Safety model"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Install and update operations are staged in a new physical Profile generation.\n- Package-manager l"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ifecycle scripts are disabled by default.\n- Registry documents are strictly parsed and remote replac"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ements require a configured Ed25519 signature.\n- A candidate generation becomes current only after c"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"onfiguration validation and runtime readiness confirmation.\n- Failed candidates are discarded and th"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"e previous generation remains recoverable."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- Architecture\n- Adapters\n- Chinese README"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
